{"event": "tool_call", "t": 1795197989.08, "name": "report", "arguments": {"verdict": "fixed", "root_cause": {"category": "logic", "model": "rpt_category_performance", "summary": "The model drives from products and LEFT JOINs down to orders. Order lines with no matching order header (18 ORPHAN-ORD lines, 2,950.78 revenue) and products with no sales therefore land in a NULL sales_month group, which inflates unique_products with products that never sold and puts unattributable revenue in a non-month bucket. Making the orders join inner keeps only lines with a valid order date."}, "evidence": [{"kind": "query", "ref": "stg_orders__order_lines vs stg_orders__orders", "finding": "18 order lines have order_id values (ORPHAN-ORD-*) with no matching row in stg_orders__orders; total line_total 2,950.78, all under PHYSICAL products."}, {"kind": "query", "ref": "products LEFT JOIN variants/lines/orders where ordered_at is null", "finding": "Null-month group had PHYSICAL 132 products (18 lines), DIGITAL 8, SERVICE 6, GIFT_CARD 2 products with no sales; these inflated unique_products in NULL-month rows."}, {"kind": "query", "ref": "source reconciliation", "finding": "Source line_total sum 722,313.24 equals the report revenue sum before the fix; after the fix it is 719,362.46 = source minus the orphan lines. Units 6,590 -> 6,559 (orphan units removed). No null sales_month rows remain."}, {"kind": "query", "ref": "uniqueness checks", "finding": "stg_product__products, stg_product__product_variants, stg_orders__order_lines and stg_orders__orders are unique on their keys, so the join chain does not fan out."}, {"kind": "log", "ref": "run_dbt rpt_category_performance+", "finding": "Build succeeded (1 node, success=1)."}], "changes": [{"path": "models/marts/product/rpt_category_performance.sql", "summary": "Changed the orders join from LEFT JOIN to inner JOIN so only order lines with a valid order header (and therefore a sales_month) are counted. Removes the NULL sales_month bucket and the products with no sales that inflated unique_products. Output columns, grain and materialization are unchanged."}], "confidence": "medium"}, "duration_s": 113.87, "output_chars": 104, "is_error": false}
